  {
   "id": "whisker-waters-266497@2",
   "gameId": "whisker-waters-266497",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 2",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-02T15:42:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Meowdy Rangers!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've rustled up some fixes, with more on the way, thank you so much for your love and support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here's a list of fixes for you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Key Binding Issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Previous bound keys are no longer removed. Note: There is still a 'replace' prompt screen that appears when trying to change a key binding already in use, but it will not replace it. Players can now assign keys wherever they wish. The 'replace' pop-up will be removed in the next patch, but for the current purposes, this issue is fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Controller Menu",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Players can now use the controller to select menu options with a button press, eliminating the need to navigate via the radial menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Apple Spawn Rate Increase",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Increased the spawn rates of apples. Inconsistent spawns were leading to frustration, especially for the opening quest where players need to collect 3 apples. There should now be plentiful amounts available for players to complete the quest.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Stickball Achievement",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Stickball achievement now works correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Log Spawning",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Logs now spawn on the ground, resolving floating log issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please report any bugs or issues you encounter while playing the game here, and we will do our best to address them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have more fixes on the way so make sure to follow us here and on socials!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord: https://discord.gg/mergegames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter - https://twitter.com/MergeGamesLtd",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/MergeGamesLtd",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
